        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "#55, \u201cPossible GLM4 32B regression,\u201d reports a loading TypeError rather than numerical overflow. Its inferred association is the matching LinearFP16 constructor and Linear.load_fp16 source, not an Ernie-specific relationship.",
